  "cross_country_rules": [
    "Same platform (YouTube), same planner family and DataReportal report edition; nevertheless vendor corrections and market targeting affect reported ad reach.",
    "Do not assume the 2025 quarter-level and end-2024-to-late-2025 comparisons are interchangeable time periods.",
    "July–October figures cover only the final portion of the longer reported annual comparison, with no additional inferred intermediate points.",
    "Treat 500 million reported India targetable ad reach and its change as planner-facing quantities, never 500 million verified unique monthly people.",
    "A negative ad reach change can reflect eligibility rules, deduplication or platform-tool corrections and is not proof humans stopped watching.",
